; The other half of the same measurement, and it is a staleness rather than an agreement. Both
; order owners carry an inbound census taken before this file existed: order-status records two
; contracts naming it and order-money records four. This file makes each of those one short. The
; neighbours are not edited from here -- a census is a dated reading, not a running total -- so
; what is declared instead is that the readings predate this contract.
