pub const D14_NOTE : str = "D14. The detail screen renders an order id tail, an address, a delivery note and a phone number when the server sends them, at src/ui/screens/order_detail_screen.rs:182-190 and :301-309. That those four rows exist is a structural fact about the screen and is recorded. No value of any of them appears in this file, in any test argument, or in any example, and none ever may.";
