pub const INVENTION_NOTE : str = "The eighth label is a label for the absence of a recognised name and not a ninth state. This file adds no name to the vocabulary, renames none, and takes no position on which member of the alias pair is the alias -- that question belongs to the order-status contract and is left open on purpose. The repair of 2026-09-22 added no name and no key either, and kept both shared arms exactly as they shipped.";
; Added 2026-09-22 with the money repair: two places where nothing publishes an answer and this
; file declines to supply one.
; The first is a SENTENCE. D9 requires the dash and nothing more, and the dash on these screens --
